<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,460.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,460.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,460 today from 1,463 on Feb 24, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates</p>
<p>in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1537    13.956	  1541    13.988</p>
<p>   1a   1484 11238.000	  1496 11331.000</p>
